@title Controller card: pop a controller out into its own window
@area Live
@sizes 1366x768
# Lane C3. "Pop out" on the Controller card opens the selected controller in a window of its own,
# with an Active or Idle mark; the card stays.
open qa/fixtures/radio-hoist.novo
wait 20
key shift+l
wait 20
click_text "Controller…"
wait 20
click_text "Pop out"
wait 20
shot popped-out
expect "Controller Radio, 3 motions, 2-step"
expect "Idle"
check_layout
